      "description": "Unlock a world of health & wellness with the Holland & Barrett app - your ultimate health & wellness companion. Whether you're looking to build muscle, eating healthier options, or find expert advice on skincare, vegan recipes, and menopause support. Our app is designed to help you achieve your goals.\n\nWhy download the Holland & Barrett App?\n\n- Exclusive offers: Get app-only discounts, special promotions, and product deals that are too good to miss.\n- Personalised recommendations: Discover products tailored to your wellness needs with suggestions for vitamins, supplements, sports nutrition, beauty, food, drinks and more.\n- H&B&Me is our loyalty programme – collect points as you shop, track your balance in the app, and use your points for instant savings.\n- Subscribe & save: Never run out of your favourite products again with easy, regular deliveries.\n- Wellness inspiration: Access expert-tailored advice, recipes, at-home workouts, podcasts and more through our Health Hub.\n- Scan & learn: Use the barcode scanner to easily learn about products while shopping in-store or reorder your favourites at home.\n- Click & collect: Shop online and pick up your order in-store at your convenience.\n- Store locator: Find your nearest branch with our handy locator, so you can shop in-person or collect your online orders.\n\n\nGet everything you need to live happier, right at your fingertips. From natural beauty products, food and drink, to fitness gear and supplements, the Holland & Barrett app is the easy way to access high-quality wellness products anytime, anywhere. Plus, with fast, secure checkout and reliable delivery options, you'll never have to wait long to start your wellness journey.\n \n\nSupport your health & wellness, for overall well-being with H&B's range of vitamins. From immunity support, and skin to bone health, our high-quality products are designed to fill nutritional gaps and help you stay healthy, where possible.\n\n\n Unlock your fitness potential with H&B's sports range, packed with protein powders, BCAAs, pre-workout, and shakes. Fuel your workouts and optimise performance, whether you're hitting the gym or training for your next challenge.\n\n\nGlow with H&B's beauty range. Our expertly formulated skincare and haircare products nourish and enhance your natural beauty, offering everything from skin boosters to hair-nourishing actives.\n\n\nFuel your day with H&B's food and drink range, featuring delicious, nutritious options for every lifestyle. From protein-packed snacks and meal replacements to smoothies and superfoods, our products may help you stay energised and ready for your day.\n\n\nDon't miss out! Download the Holland & Barrett app today and take the next step toward a healthier, happier you! Turn on notifications so you never miss an exclusive offer, new product or health and wellness tip!",
